class: runtime
profiles: standard
summary: [0300] a checked overflow the compiler could not read traps, and [1960] stops the program there
constructs: 0300, 1770, 1800, 1920, 1960
program: main.ldn
traps: yes
targets: linux-x86-64, linux-arm64, macos-arm64, freebsd-x86-64, freebsd-arm64, linux-rv64
